Subject: [PATCH 93/94] test(web): expand collapsed groups in carried sidebar
 tests

With #2165 a collapsed group no longer mounts its rows, so the carried
#1418, #1944 and #2080 tests open the group before using a row in it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
